* ''The carriage log, and a sixth floor duty'' (operator, 2026-11-09). A place's relay state rests in its public carriage log: append-only, unsealed, keyed by the carriage's own id, each receipt signed under the place key as the sixth floor duty, `CARRIAGE_RECEIPT_DOMAIN` (`place-signer.ts`), herm and hearth alike. <<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lararium/mesh/lamplighters#/the-carriage-log`>>.

